---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { journal } from '../lib/journal';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Call for Papers"
  subtitle="Contribute to our inaugural issue."
  description="IJATS invites original research articles, case studies, technical notes, and reviews across applied technology domains."
>
  <p>
    The <strong>{journal.name} ({journal.shortName})</strong> invites researchers,
    practitioners, and innovators to submit high-quality, original research
    articles, case studies, technical notes, and review papers for our inaugural
    issue.
  </p>
  <p>
    We are seeking impactful contributions that bridge theory and practice across
    a wide range of technology domains, including:
  </p>
  <ul>
    {journal.scope.map((topic) => <li>{topic}</li>)}
  </ul>

  <h2>Important Dates</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Submission Deadline:</strong> Rolling — submissions accepted on an ongoing basis.</li>
    <li><strong>Notification of Acceptance:</strong> Typically within 4–6 weeks of submission.</li>
    <li><strong>Publication:</strong> Accepted papers are assigned to the next available issue.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Submission Guidelines</h2>
  <p>
    Manuscripts should be submitted electronically by email to
    <a href={`mailto:${journal.email.submissions}`}>{journal.email.submissions}</a>.
    Submissions must follow the journal's
    <a href="/editorial-policies">Editorial Policies</a> regarding peer review,
    ethics, and formatting. See <a href="/submit">Submit a Paper</a> for the full
    checklist.
  </p>

  <h2>Open Access Policy</h2>
  <p>
    IJATS is an open-access journal. All published articles are freely available
    online without subscription barriers, promoting global knowledge sharing and
    visibility. There are <strong>no Article Processing Charges (APCs)</strong> for
    papers accepted in the inaugural issues.
  </p>

  <h2>Join Us</h2>
  <p>
    Be part of IJATS's mission to drive technological innovation into real-world
    solutions. We look forward to receiving your valuable contributions!
  </p>
</PageLayout>
